OL,3,GNEWSAPublication of review into arrest 
OL,4,Avideo delayed                          
OL,6,FAn independent report examining how and
OL,7,Fwhy police failed to hand over         
OL,8,Fbody-worn video of an arrest has been  
OL,9,Fdelayed.                               
OL,11,FNadine Buzzard-Quashie began a legal   
OL,12,Fbattle after Northamptonshire Police   
OL,13,Ffailed to provide footage of her arrest
OL,14,Fin September 2021. It resulted in the  
OL,15,Fforce being fined #50,000 for          
OL,16,Fwithholding it.                        
OL,18,FAn independent review, commissioned by 
OL,19,FPolice, Fire and Crime Commissioner    
OL,20,FDanielle Stone, was due to be presented
OL,21,Fto the county's police, fire and crime 
OL,22,Fpanel on 3 December.                   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
